  words:
  - "So this\u2026 | this was me? | Before everything changed? ||"
  - "Alam : Not just before, this is you, Kiara. |The parts you thought you lost\u2026
    | they\u2019ve simply been waiting for you to remember.  ||"
  - "Am I\u2026 allowed to claim it all back? ||"
  - Can I really call this myself? ||
  - (Kiara touched her heart. A figure similar to Kiara's marionette appears.)  ||
  - ' '
